njoy a pool and an outdoor pool. In the hotel, you can arrange a business meeting, a board meeting, and even a job as there is a business center and event facilities. Want to have an excursion? Consult the tour assistance desk of the hotel.","Accessible for guests with disabilities: the elevator helps them to go to the highest floors. At the guests’ disposal, there’s also a laundry, dry cleaning, an ATM, private check-in and check-out, ironing, press, car rental, a safe-deposit box and a concierge. The staff of the hotel speaks English, German, Russian and French."],"title":"At the hotel"},{"paragraphs":["The room is warmly decorated and has everything you need to have a rest after a long eventful day. There is an alarm clock, a shower, a TV, a mini-bar, a bathrobe and slippers. The room equipment depends on its category."],"title":"Room amenities"}],"email":"h6305-re@accor.com, h6305-re@accor.com","hotel_chain":"","hid":6362880,"id":"pullman_dubai_jumeirah_lakes_towers__hotel_and_residence","images_ext":[{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/ostrovok/f7/24/f7241553368a468915616c2b28fa432b3d5a85d9.JPEG","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/ostrovok/33/d2/33d2e5a3cba5ba55adf55ec515447b4cda09ebc6.JPEG","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/ostrovok/cd/8a/cd8af49af13b55ae484f23e76e396095f9b75cc6.JPEG","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/ostrovok/80/77/8077b066fae94854691673763a4c147e42d246d9.JPEG","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/ostrovok/1a/b6/1ab62983dae72ba10e0f31b8f24f565a5201199b.JPEG","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/ostrovok/29/ae/29aea06f6d290a367ea435e8c0364afe75fadfc0.JPEG","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/ostrovok/b2/8e/b28e35223c8debfc7da677bd680223074612e0e7.JPEG","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t