the city center. You can take a walk and explore the neighbourhood area of the hotel — Al Rigga, Dubai Creek and Mamzar Beach Park."],"title":"Location"},{"paragraphs":["You can stop by the bar and the restaurant. Free Wi-Fi on the territory will help you to stay on-line.","If you travel by car, you can park in a parking zone. The beauty and wellness services: a massage room, a sauna, a steam bath and a spa center. Guests who love doing sports will be able to enjoy a fitness center and a gym. Here, you can treat yourself with water procedures as there will be a pool, an indoor pool and an outdoor pool.","You can arrange a business meeting, a board meeting, and even a job interview as there is a conference hall. The tour assistance desk of the hotel will help you book an excursion. The staff of the hotel will order a transfer for you. Accessible for guests with disabilities: the elevator helps them to go to the highest floors.","At the guests’ disposal, there’s also a laundry, dry cleaning, an ATM, private check-in and check-out, ironing, press, car rental, a safe-deposit box and a concierge. The staff of the hotel will be happy to talk to you in English and Italian."],"title":"At the hotel"},{"paragraphs":["Here’s what you’ll find in the room to have a rest after a long day: an alarm clock, a shower, a TV, a mini-bar, a bathrobe and slippers. Please note that the listed services may not be available in all the rooms."],"title":"Room amenities"}],"email":"reserveavani@avanihotels.com","hotel_chain":"","hid":7800877,"id":"movenpick_hotel_deira_4","images_ext":[{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/7f/cd/7fcd65a7664becb76378d7be752f8dc0919fb621.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/6c/eb/6ceb64346d078e76dffd7c65d59dc9c12cc41205.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/95/60/956015cea481735922318d889e079661af618d62.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https