’t live without swimming will appreciate an outdoor pool. You can arrange a business meeting, a board meeting, and even a job interview as there is a business center. Want to have an excursion? Consult the tour assistance desk of the hotel. Accessible for guests with disabilities: the elevator helps them to go to the highest floors.","At the guests’ disposal, there’s also a laundry, dry cleaning, an ATM, car rental, a safe-deposit box and a concierge. The staff of the hotel speaks English and Spanish."],"title":"At the hotel"},{"paragraphs":["In the room, there is an alarm clock, a TV, a mini-bar, a bathrobe and slippers. Please note that the listed services may not be available in all the rooms."],"title":"Room amenities"}],"email":"reservations.hyattplacedubai@hyatt.com","hotel_chain":"","hid":9226177,"id":"hyatt_place_dubai_jumeirah_residences","images_ext":[{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/e2/5a/e25a01e9c1c230b46550f5dc909e7294011062f5.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/46/03/460338bb7b19493025d85867e8a1d5782e6090c3.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/5b/6c/5b6cd2edbda3bf31fb71b58118f5aabe05f352e1.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/92/54/9254b21dc5fb170c4cfcfadd4c8fb2bad4fe3c9d.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/f2/74/f274523dfc6569469cb7e26c1db8108844ab86ce.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/2c/d2/2cd26d7c248727aa104af7d2a380dfbbab5cad9e.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/b8/f8/b8f84109ea4002381ced0c895e63f16e54301b14.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/ca/dd/cadd78137fff83889e293058edf6ffb5fbb18aae.webp","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/13/3