droom Apartment Dubai Fountain &amp; Old Town View by Auberge» is situated in Dubai. This hostel is located in 7 km from the city center. You can take a walk and explore the neighbourhood area of the hostel — Burj Khalifa, The Dubai Fountain and Dubai Aquarium &amp; Underwater Zoo."],"title":"Location"},{"paragraphs":["Spend an evening in a nice atmosphere of the bar. Free Wi-Fi on the territory will help you to stay on-line. If you travel by car, you can park in a parking zone. Also, the following services are available for guests at the hostel: a sauna and a doctor.","Sports fans are going to love a fitness center. The following services are available At the hostel for winter sports fans: a skiing area. Tourists who can’t live without swimming will appreciate a pool, an aquapark and an outdoor pool. If you want to make your journey even more comfortable, you can order a transfer.","Accessible for guests with disabilities: the elevator helps them to go to the highest floors. Additional services that the hostel offers to its guests: a laundry, dry cleaning, ironing and a safe-deposit box."],"title":"At the hostel"},{"paragraphs":["Guests will find the following in the room: a shower and a TV. The room equipment depends on its category."],"title":"Room amenities"}],"email":"tobias_rolle@yahoo.de","hotel_chain":"","hid":10579396,"id":"one_bedroom_apartment_dubai_fountain_old_town_view_by_auberge","images_ext":[{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/35/0f/350f2bb78fd984a14b34d8fcd57aebefb9fa9880.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/de/24/de24100793aedc89e6f8c355b6f7620331440743.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/01/8c/018cd594b0722f6664a9f3608edd0d58620064f5.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net/t/{size}/content/b9/8a/b98acc2b526106dbba41ba545e8aa31f88f7fd56.jpeg","category_slug":"unspecified"},{"url":"https://cdn.worldota.net